 Space Prison Sargasso. He added that he had given them a battle machine \"Dag Beagle\" made by copying machines on the Earth in order to fight against Sargasso.\n\nThey turned into Dagwon by the power of Bravian, and fought against space monsters. At that moment, the patrol car came in front of En. En grew into the car and turned into the Brave Robot Dag Fire, then beaten the enemy. However, the fight between the Brave Dagwon and the felonious aliens of Sargasso had just begun."},"tags":[{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Robot","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tokusatsu","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Delinquents","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Yuusha Shirei Dagwon","english":null,"native":"勇者指令ダグオン","romaji":"Yuusha Shirei Dagwon","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"勇者指令"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"COMMAND OF BRAVES DAGWON"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"勇者指令DAGWON"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}